This project tests the following 10 methods 

Email   addBcc(String... emails)

Email   addCc(String email)

void     addHeader(String name, String value)

Email   addReplyTo(String email, String name)

void     buildMimeMessage()

String  getHostName()

Session getMailSession()

Date    getSentDate()

int        getSocketConnectionTimeout()

Email   setFrom(String email)

Using Junit framework in Eclipse.

The project uses Java 11.09 and needs to have maven installed


 